    - target: {fileID: 7025344861841455819, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: NPC
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: npcId
      value: bartender
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: Bartender
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: journalInformation
      value: He said to check the motel for the guest in room 49
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogueLines.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "I couldn\u2019t tell you who makes the wine. It gets delivered regularly,
        but not by anyone I know well enough to ask."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "We don\u2019t serve it anymore. Too many people complained about the
        taste, and eventually there weren\u2019t enough people ordering it to justify
        keeping it on the menu."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: A tourist asked about it once. A lot of questions. Where the flowers
        came from, who made the wine, whether the recipe had changed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: "They asked whether banana slug essence was still used in the preparation.
        I told them I\u2019d never heard of banana slugs being used in wine. They
        said they hadn\u2019t asked whether I\u2019d heard of it."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[4]'
      value: "They asked whether it was made in a laboratory beneath the old observatory.
        I told them I\u2019d never heard of a laboratory beneath anything."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8028808172065697213, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[5]'
      value: They were staying at the motel. Room 49, I think. The receptionist might
        remember them better than I do.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 4823f6e19886c409f9be3177774e8584, type: 3}
